&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Have acquired a bachelor’s or master&#39;s degree with outstanding results&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Have a UK work permit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Possess exceptional analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Are an excellent communicator in English, writing and verbally with exceptional attention to detail.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
