&lt;li&gt;Advanced level in excel is required; experience with analytics tools (Google Analytics, Piano, Adobe …), DSP (DV, TTD …), ad server (Adform, CM…) and tracking tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly developed analytical and problem-solving skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify and understand customer needs and requirements, exceptional communication skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;University degree (preferably in the field of business, marketing, engineering or communication);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of motivation and willingness to learn with high energy and positive “can do” attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with generative AI tools (e.g.,&amp;nbsp; Gemini, Claude) to improve productivity, data analysis, and client communications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in/within adtech context would be a big advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both written and spoken French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
